# Naval wins, Combat Analysis on: a Privateer takes a Caravel's cargo and sinks it; a Frigate takes one
# hold from a Merchantman (@PICKACARGO) and drives it off damaged.
# Start: map_attack_naval_privateer's input.sav (France, Spring 1600, turn 108, at war with England;
# French Privateer #79 at (47,24) active, Frigate #121 at (47,23) with 3 of 4 holds used), fixture:
# English Caravel #0 at (48,24) given 100 Furs + 100 Tools (holds_occupied 2), English Merchantman #76
# (100 Muskets / Tools / Trade Goods / Horses) moved from (33,34) to sea (48,22) with no orders;
# re-saved once, then RT_RNG LCG state set to 134623. Rolls come from the saved LCG, so the outcomes
# are fixed.
key KP_6                 # Privateer attacks the Caravel east: Combat Analysis dialog
wait 3
key Return               # dismiss: evade roll fails, the Privateer wins; plunder pass 1 (both holds fit: hold 0)
wait 3
key Return               # @CARGOCAPTURE "{English} cargo of {100 Furs} captured by {French Privateer}!"
wait 3
key Return               # @CARGOCAPTURE "... {100 Tools} ..."
wait 3
key Return               # @SHIPSUNK "{English Caravel sunk} by French Privateer!" (an unarmed Caravel after turn 0x4f
wait 3                  #  always sinks, FUN_5fef_0352 raw 99527-99570); Frigate #121 selected next
key KP_9                 # Frigate attacks the Merchantman NE: Combat Analysis dialog
wait 3
key Return               # dismiss: evade fails, the Frigate wins; one free hold, four loser holds:
wait 3                  #  @PICKACARGO "Which cargo shall we capture?" [Nothing, 100 Muskets, 100 Tools, 100 Trade Goods, 100 Horses]
key Down                 # row 1: 100 Muskets
wait 1
key Return               # picked: the Muskets go aboard with no @CARGOCAPTURE (a human pick clears DS:0xa154,
wait 3                  #  FUN_5fef_016c); the Merchantman's other holds are emptied (FUN_5fef_0352 5fef:05e6)
key Return               # @SHIPDAMAGE "{English Merchantman} damaged! Ship returns to {London} for repairs."
wait 3                  #  Dragoon #131 in Quebec selected next
shot
